ahi's existence and try to take her, but the former Subaru member Takanori appears. He had become the leader of the elite guild Illuminati. Asahi suggests reassembling Subaru, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5JcGcpLzSNHc25NZjLC9r07D5Y6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Haruto is shocked by Asahi's sudden appearance in Re'Union six years after her death. Asahi acts as if nothing has happened, although she's unable to log out from the game. Players have noticed Asahi's existence and try to take her, but the former Subaru member Takanori appears. He had become the leader of the elite guild Illuminati. Asahi suggests reassembling Subaru, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5JcGcpLzSNHc25NZjLC9r07D5Y6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"13596","synopsis":"Having reunited with Asahi in Re'Union, Satsuki asks Asahi to stay away from Haruto for his sake. However, Satsuki realizes that she was jealous of Asahi after witnessing her share a moment with Haruto six years ago, and vows to herself that she won't lose this time. In order to find out Asahi's identity, the three of them head to the dungeon where Asahi got her game over all those years ago.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/enrPG3d0d7YCf38nxrkkkHQzLyV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Having reunited with Asahi in Re'Union, Satsuki asks Asahi to stay away from Haruto for his sake. However, Satsuki realizes that she was jealous 