mber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"13599","synopsis":"After telling Haruto that he didn't have the right to protect Asahi, Takanori used his Divine Sense to teleport Haruto and himself to the Monochrome world. Takanori and Haruto butt heads, but Satsuki manages to intervene before it gets too far. They search for one of the former Subaru members Clive, when Takanori reappears to try to take Asahi away with the help of two major elite guilds.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oJFgUWedh0YdaEeq1GHXxQ2I3E2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"After telling Haruto that he didn't have the right to protect Asahi, Takanori used his Divine Sense to teleport Haruto and himself to the Monochrome world. Takanori and Haruto butt heads, but Satsuki manages to intervene before it gets too far. They search for one of the former Subaru members Clive, when Takanori reappears to try to take Asahi away with the help of two major elite guilds.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oJFgUWedh0YdaEeq1GHXxQ2I3E2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"13595","synopsis":"The elite guilds Southern Cross and the Brill Society capture Asahi after Takanori falls for their ruse. In order to save Asahi, Haruto goes up against thousands of enemies alone, but ends up outnumbered until Satsuki and Takanori come to his aid. The three of them finally reach Asahi, only to discover that Angelus has taken control of her spirit in order to control the Prophet Art.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4y90nXlTmirJouX5Pru2TTg48Aw.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The elite guilds Southern Cross and the Brill Society capture Asahi after Takanori falls for their ruse. In order to save Asahi, Haruto goes up against thousands of enemies alone, but ends up outnumbered until Satsuki and Takanori come to his aid. The three of them finally reach Asahi, only to discover that Angelus has taken control of her spirit in order to control the Prophet Art.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4y90nXlTmirJouX5Pru2TTg48Aw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"13592","synopsis":"Haruto hears a rumor about an unbreakable sword thrust into the bottom of the sea, and heads out to sea on Captain Alwida's ship. Haruto finds his old pal Pleiades at the bottom of the sea. However, when he tries to pull it out, a huge snake monster named Aegir appears. Meanwhile, Takanori meets up with Haruto and Satsuki in the real world and tells them what he's discovered about Asahi's secret.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/am0zp07CxRUl3zyi7OgCesrmfcz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Haruto hears a rumor about an unbreakable sword thrust into the bottom of the sea, and heads out to sea on Captain Alwida's ship. Haruto finds his old pal Pleiades at the bottom of the sea. However, when he tries to pull it out, a huge snake monster named Aegir appears. Meanwhile, Takanori meets up with Haruto and Satsuki in the real world and tells them what he's discovered about Asahi's secret.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/am0zp07CxRUl3zyi7OgCesrmfcz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"13601","synopsis":"Haruto wakes up to the sound of a beeping EKG to find Asahi standing over him. \"I'd be surprised if I were you, too. You've been asleep for six years,\" says Asahi, who came with Satsuki and Takanori to visit him. Asahi explains that Haruto got a game over when he protected Nozomi from Purgatorio. However, Haruto isn't satisfied with the explanation and questions them about Re'Union.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poSGbnKNxZor7yHP367cWiLCND2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Haruto wakes up to the sound of a beeping EKG to find Asahi standing over him. \"I'd be surprised if I were you, too. You've been asleep for six years,\" says Asahi, who came with Satsuki and Takanori to visit him. Asahi explains that Haruto got a game over when he protected Nozomi from Purgatorio. However, Haruto isn't satisfied with the explanation and questions them about Re'Union.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poSGbnKNxZor7yHP367cWiLCND2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"13591","synopsis":"In Re'Union, Haruto retakes possession of Pleiades, which holds the power of the members of Subaru. Clive received a request for help from Elicia, and tells everyone that Elicia says that in order to stop Gnosis from awakening Asahi, it is necessary to awaken all the members of Subaru. Meanwhile, Haruto and Satsuki reunite with Nozomi in the real world, and ask her to log into Re'Union again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tkEMlRJF60ToCQNQj9FWpnaozOZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"In Re'Union, Haruto retakes possession of Pleiades, which holds the power of the members of Subaru. Clive received a request for help from Elicia, and tells everyone that Elicia says that in order to stop Gnosis from awakening Asahi, it is necessary to awaken all the members of Subaru. Meanwhile, Haruto and Satsuki reunite with Nozomi in the real world, and ask her to log into Re'Union again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tkEMlRJF60ToCQNQj9FWpnaozOZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"13600","synopsis":"After getting rejected by Haruto, Satsuki tries to sort out her feelings and reminds herself they're still childhood friends. Meanwhile, Takanori tells them that Nozomi has gone missing in real life. With Clive's help, they find out that Nozomi is logged in to Re'Union and go to find her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/538uSnHAfBw5sDvzsryqFsDuwsn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"After getting rejected by Haruto, Satsuki tries to sort out her feelings and reminds herself they're still childhood friends. Meanwhile, Takanori tells them that Nozomi has gone missing in real life. With Clive's help, they find out that Nozomi is logged in to Re'Union and go to find her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/538uSnHAfBw5sDvzsryqFsDuwsn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"13593","synopsis":"Haruto, Satsuki, and Takanori meet up in real life to discuss how to rescue Nozomi. However, they suddenly find themselves caught up in a strange phenomenon, when a mysterious man appears and tells them that in order to change the future, they need the power to choose an ideal world. Recalling Elicia's story, they conclude that the man must have used one of the Senses from Re'Union in real life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jcXhlHMBKcYg6RczawDVjfWjWak.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Haruto, Satsuki, and Takanori meet up in real life to discuss how to rescue Nozomi. However, they suddenly find themselves caught up in a strange phenomenon, when a mysterious man appears and tells them that in order to change the future, they need the power to choose an ideal world. Recalling Elicia's story, they conclude that the man must have used one of the Senses from Re'Union in real life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jcXhlHMBKcYg6RczawDVjfWjWak.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"13597","synopsis":"The sound of a gunshot rings throughout the Tower of the White Water Spirit. Satsuki and Clive watch as Haruto falls to the ground with blood dripping from his chest, while Asahi stands pointing her gun at him shaking her head in disbelief. As his consciousness fades away, Haruto reaches out to Asahi as she backs away, but when his hand touches her cheek, a silver light emanates from his body.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ZpnZ9zzzwPULjjHtPGCGfDE4za.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"The sound of a gunshot rings throughout the Tower of the White Water Spirit. Satsuki and Clive watch as Haruto falls to the ground with blood dripping from his chest, while Asahi stands pointing her gun at him shaking her head in disbelief. As his consciousness fades away, Haruto reaches out to Asahi as she backs away, but when his hand touches her cheek, a silver light emanates from his body.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ZpnZ9zzzwPULjjHtPGCGfDE4za.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":100085,"malId":36316},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:100085","mal:36316"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13439","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100085","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"36316","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80562","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"346676","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":256,"title":"Shichisei no Subaru","title_eng":"Seven Senses of the Re'Union","slug":"seven-senses-of-the-reunion","plot":"All’interno del popolare mondo MMORPG di “Union” esisteva un tempo un party leggendario: Subaru. I vari membri del party, tutti studenti delle elementari appartenenti allo stesso gruppo di amici d’infanzia, si erano guadagnati una fama quasi istantanea grazie ad abilità senza precedenti all’interno del Sense, il sistema alla base del gioco. Union, però, viene chiuso in seguito ad un incidente in cui un giocatore aveva perso la vita all’interno del gioco; Subaru viene così sciolto e gli amici d’infanzia prendono strade diverse. Sei anni passano: Haruto Amō, un tempo membro chiave di Subaru, è uno studente delle superiori senza speranze, amici o ambizione. Quando un compagno di classe lo convince a giocare al nuovo “Re’Union”, Haruto finisce per vivere per davvero una riunione alquanto incredibile… Nel gioco, infatti, il ragazzo incontra la stessa vittima dell’incidente di anni prima: Asahi Kuga, un tempo membro di Subaru e amica d’infanzia di Haruto. Si tratta di un bug? Un errore di sistema? Eppure la ragazza sembra davvero essere all’interno del gioco… Qual è il mistero dietro alla sua presenza? Una nuova leggenda inizia dopo la riunione del duo!","type":"TV","status":"Terminato","date":"2018","studio":"Lerche","dub":0,"mal_id":36316,"anilist_id":100085,"imageurl":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/nx100085-vlkcAE221VeM.jpg","imageurl_cover":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/100085-odD0sJpRe3eF.jpg","cover":null,"score":"7.30","episodes_count":12,"genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Game","Romance","Sci-fi"],"related":[]},"embedded":{"id":256,"user_id":78495,"title":"Shichisei no Subaru","imageurl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx100085-vlkcAE221VeM.jpg","plot":"All’interno del popolare mondo MMORPG di “Union” esisteva un tempo un party leggendario: Subaru. I vari membri del party, tutti studenti delle elementari appartenenti allo stesso gruppo di amici d’infanzia, si erano guadagnati una fama quasi istantanea grazie ad abilità senza precedenti all’interno del Sense, il sistema alla base del gioco. Union, però, viene chiuso in seguito ad un incidente in cui un giocatore aveva perso la vita all’interno del gioco; Subaru viene così sciolto e gli amici d’infanzia prendono strade diverse. Sei anni passano: Haruto Amō, un tempo membro chiave di Subaru, è uno studente delle superiori senza speranze, amici o ambizione. Quando un compagno di classe lo convince a giocare al nuovo “Re’Union”, Haruto finisce per vivere per davvero una riunione alquanto incredibile… Nel gioco, infatti, il ragazzo incontra la stessa vittima dell’incidente di anni prima: Asahi Kuga, un tempo membro di Subaru e amica d’infanzia di Haruto. Si tratta di un bug? Un errore di sistema? Eppure la ragazza sembra davvero essere all’interno del gioco… Qual è il mistero dietro alla sua presenza? Una nuova leggenda inizia dopo la riunione del duo!","date":"2018","episodes_count":12,"episodes_length":24,"author":" ","created_at":"2018-07-29 14:17:59","status":"Terminato","imageurl_cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/100085-odD0sJpRe3eF.jpg","type":"TV","slug